            <strong>Storage units in Vernal, Utah</strong> from Fort Knox Self Storage. Mouse-proof steel containers from <strong>$130/month</strong>. 24/7 access, no hidden fees, fireproof construction. 20ft and 40ft units plus vehicle parking. First 2 months FREE with 6-month contract. Located at <strong>2225 South 3250 East, Vernal, UT 84078</strong>. Call <a href="tel:4358287710">James Richards at 435-828-7710</a>.
          </p>
          <span class="page-summary-meta">Last updated: <time datetime="2026-04-09">April 2026</time></span>
        </div>
        <div class="voice-answer-block">
          <p><strong>Looking for storage units in Vernal, Utah?</strong> Fort Knox Self Storage has mouse-proof steel containers starting at $130 per month with 24/7 access and no hidden fees. Call James at 435-828-7710 to reserve your unit today.</p>
        </div>

      <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8;">

        <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
          Fort Knox Self Storage is the only storage facility in the Vernal area that uses all-steel shipping containers instead of traditional wood-frame buildings. Every unit is completely sealed against mice, spiders, dust, and fire. There are no admin fees, no deposits, no rate hikes — and your first two months are free when you sign a 6-month contract.
        </p>

        <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
          Whether you're storing household furniture during a <a href="/renovation-storage" style="color: var(--primary-dark); font-weight: 600;">home renovation</a>, protecting <a href="/hunting-season-storage" style="color: var(--primary-dark); font-weight: 600;">hunting gear between seasons</a>, securing <a href="/construction-equipment-storage" style="color: var(--primary-dark); font-weight: 600;">contractor tools and materials</a>, or parking an RV — Fort Knox has the space, the security, and the price point.
        </p>

        <!-- ═══ UNIT CATALOG ═══ -->
        <h2 style="font-family: 'Georgia', serif; font-size: 1.8rem; color: var(--primary-dark); margin: 40px 0 12px;">The Fort Knox Unit Catalog — Every Unit We Rent</h2>

        <p style="margin-bottom: 24px;">Fort Knox rents three things: a 20ft container, a 40ft container, and an outdoor parking space. That's the whole catalog. Below is exactly what each one measures, what actually fits inside it, and what it costs — so you can pick the unit before you call.</p>

        <!-- 20FT -->
        <div style="border: 3px solid var(--primary-dark); border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; background: white; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
