          <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><strong>What fits:</strong> an entire 3–4 bedroom home plus a full garage — all furniture, appliances, boxes, ATVs or motorcycles, oilfield equipment, ranch and farm supplies, and large contractor gear.</p>
          <p style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><strong>Rent this one if:</strong> you're storing a whole household, running business inventory out of a <a href="/business-storage" style="color: var(--primary-dark); font-weight: 600;">mini warehouse</a>, or you need shelving and tall items standing upright — that's what the High Cube is for.</p>

