          <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><strong>What fits:</strong> RVs of all classes, motorhomes, boats on trailers, campers, fifth wheels, travel trailers, toy haulers, ATVs on trailers, trucks and SUVs.</p>
          <p style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><strong>Rent this one if:</strong> the thing you're storing has wheels and doesn't need to be under a roof. Call to confirm your vehicle's dimensions against current space availability.</p>

