        </ul>

        <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Want the money side first? The <a href="/storage-cost-vernal-utah" style="color: var(--primary-dark); font-weight: 600;">full storage cost breakdown for Vernal</a> covers what each unit runs per month, what the 6-month deal changes, and what isn't charged. <strong>First 2 months FREE with a 6-month contract</strong> — that puts a 20ft at roughly <a href="/cheap-storage-vernal-utah" style="color: var(--primary-dark); font-weight: 600;">$87/month effective</a>.</p>

